{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 5188773, "items": [{"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2024, 8, 12]], "date-time": "2024-08-12T16:33:03Z", "timestamp": 1723480383670}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Oxford University Press (OUP)", "issue": "1", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "DOI": "10.5840/monist19978012", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2012, 10, 11]], "date-time": "2012-10-11T15:23:17Z", "timestamp": 1349968997000}, "page": "44-69", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 10, "title": ["Naturalizing Metaphysics"], "prefix": "10.1093", "volume": "80", "author": [{"given": "Simon", "family": "Saunders", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"name": "The Hegeler Institute", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "286", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}, "container-title": ["Monist"], "language": "de", "link": [{"URL": "http://academic.oup.com/monist/article-pdf/80/1/44/6196415/monist80-0044.pdf", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2017, 8, 23]], "date-time": "2017-08-23T15:39:11Z", "timestamp": 1503502751000}, "score": 72.6575, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://academic.oup.com/monist/article-lookup/doi/10.5840/monist19978012"}}, "subtitle": [""], "editor": [{"given": "Sherwood J. B.", "family": "Sugden", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "editor", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "issued": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}, "references-count": 0, "journal-issue": {"issue": "1", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}}, "alternative-id": ["monist_1997_0080_0001_0044_0069"], "URL": "https://doi.org/10.5840/monist19978012", "ISSN": ["0026-9662"], "issn-type": [{"type": "print", "value": "0026-9662"}], "published": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2024, 5, 9]], "date-time": "2024-05-09T20:54:58Z", "timestamp": 1715288098255}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Oxford University Press", "isbn-type": [{"value": "9780190913151", "type": "print"}, {"value": "9780190913168", "type": "electronic"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2019, 1, 31]]}, "abstract": "<p>Quine’s negative characterization of naturalism as the rejection of first philosophy invites the question of why he believes that first philosophy ought to be dismissed. This chapter discusses Quine’s position vis-à-vis traditional metaphysics. It concludes that Quine’s views on metaphysics are subtler than is often presupposed; both the received view that Quine saved metaphysics <italic>and</italic> the opposite view that Carnap and Quine are on the same antimetaphysical team are too one-sided if we take seriously Quine’s own pronouncements on the issue. The chapter offers a detailed reconstruction of Quine’s naturalistic perspective on metaphysical existence claims and shows how he is able to both blur the boundary between scientific sense and metaphysical nonsense <italic>and</italic> to argue that we cannot ask what reality is really like in a distinctively philosophical way.</p>", "DOI": "10.1093/oso/9780190913151.003.0003", "type": "book-chapter", "created": {"date-parts": [[2018, 12, 20]], "date-time": "2018-12-20T17:48:50Z", "timestamp": 1545328130000}, "page": "36-53", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["Naturalizing Metaphysics"], "prefix": "10.1093", "author": [{"given": "Sander", "family": "Verhaegh", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "286", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2018, 12, 20]]}, "container-title": ["Working from Within"], "original-title": ["Naturalizing Metaphysics"], "language": "en", "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2022, 8, 2]], "date-time": "2022-08-02T23:32:28Z", "timestamp": 1659483148000}, "score": 34.446144, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://academic.oup.com/book/8530/chapter/154386999"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2018, 12, 20]]}, "ISBN": ["9780190913151", "9780190913168"], "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1093/oso/9780190913151.003.0003", "published": {"date-parts": [[2018, 12, 20]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 10, 3]], "date-time": "2026-10-03T16:06:16Z", "timestamp": 1791043576525, "version": "4.1.0"}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Oxford University Press (OUP)", "issue": "3", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "DOI": "10.5840/monist200790331", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2012, 10, 11]], "date-time": "2012-10-11T15:23:55Z", "timestamp": 1349969035000}, "page": "457-479", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 16, "title": ["A Program for “Naturalizing” Metaphysics, with Application to the Ontology of Events"], "prefix": "10.1093", "volume": "90", "author": [{"given": "Alvin I.", "family": "Goldman", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"name": "The Hegeler Institute", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "286", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2007]]}, "container-title": ["Monist"], "language": "de", "link": [{"URL": "http://academic.oup.com/monist/article-pdf/90/3/457/6231872/monist90-0457.pdf", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2017, 8, 23]], "date-time": "2017-08-23T14:47:56Z", "timestamp": 1503499676000}, "score": 32.934013, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://academic.oup.com/monist/article-lookup/doi/10.5840/monist200790331"}}, "subtitle": [""], 